      "widgets_values": [
        "One continuous photorealistic cinematic adventure action shot, medium wide full body view of two adult swordsmen sparring in a sunlit ancient stone courtyard. The first fighter has short dark hair and wears a navy blue tunic with brown leather armor and dark trousers; the second has short light hair and wears a burgundy tunic with dark leather armor. Each holds one steel sword. They continuously exchange controlled sword strikes, blocks, sidesteps and small lunges while circling, keeping both fighters fully visible. Their swords meet naturally and remain in their hands. The camera moves in a smooth slow arc around the pair, following the sparring without cutting. Fine dust rises at their feet, stable warm late afternoon light, realistic anatomy, cloth motion and stone texture. A single uninterrupted camera take, no teleportation. Audio: sword clashes, boot steps on stone and exertion, no music, no dialogue.",
